      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses hicieron la primera raza cuando aún reinaba Crono, el antiguo rey de los dioses.",
          "en": "The gods made the first race while Cronus, the old king, still ruled."
        },
        {
          "es": "Fue una raza de oro. Su gente vivía como los dioses, sin preocupaciones ni dolor.",
          "en": "It was a golden race. Its people lived like gods, free of worry and pain."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nunca tenían que trabajar, porque la tierra daba fruto por sí sola.",
          "en": "They never had to work, because the earth gave fruit by itself."
        },
        {
          "es": "Siempre era primavera. No había leyes ni castigos, porque nadie hacía el mal.",
          "en": "It was always spring. There were no laws or punishments, because no one did wrong."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nunca envejecían y pasaban los días de fiesta en fiesta.",
          "en": "They never grew old, and spent their days feasting."
        }
      ],
